s to swing from vines, navigate intricate tree canopies, and engage in dynamic, fast-paced chases through the lush landscape. What sets Chimpanzee Chase apart is its groundbreaking communication system, enabling players to talk to each other in real-time using an advanced vocalization translation feature. This not only enhances teamwork during the pursuit of various challenges but also creates a unique social dynamic as players strategize and communicate while swinging through the virtual jungle. The game offers a seamless blend of action and cooperative gameplay, allowing players to experience the excitement of being a chimpanzee in a vibrant, interactive world while fostering a sense of camaraderie through communication. Chimpanzee Chase is set to redefine the boundaries of VR gaming, providing an unforgettable and socially engaging experience for players.", "short_description": "You can play as a chimpanzee with voice chat and meet other people!"}]}, "developer_name": "Waterbel", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://waterbel.wixsite.com/watergames/kopie-van-chimpanzee-chase", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Waterbel", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://waterbel.wixsite.com/watergames", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "7243531959066853"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "i